---
description: Source-scan guards (test/m1-guards.test.js) that every change to lib/ and server.js must respect
globs: lib/**/*.js,server.js,config.js
alwaysApply: false
---

`test/m1-guards.test.js` greps the source tree; a violation fails the suite. Respect these when writing code:

- **Ollama only in `lib/ollama.js`** (and `config.js`): no `11434`, no `/api/chat|tags|show|pull|ps|delete` strings elsewhere. Consequently none of our own routes may contain those (no `/api/chat...`, `/api/show...`); chat lives at `/api/conversations` and `/api/mentions`, `/api/llm/info`.
- **Raw git only in `lib/proc.js`** (and `lib/safegit.js`): call `git(cwd, [args])` from `./proc`, never `execFile('git'...)`, `spawn('git'...)` or `run('git'...)`. Always an argv array, `--` before paths, cwd from `lib/repo.js` (`assertUsable`), never from a project (`git(project.` is banned; `project.path`/`project.default_branch` are legacy and banned).
- **No recursive/destructive fs outside `lib/fsguard.js`**: no `rmSync`, `rmdirSync`, `fs.rm(`, `rimraf`, `unlinkSync`. Remove owned dirs with `fsguard.removeOwnedDir`, or rename to the trash; remove worktrees with `git worktree remove`.
- **No shell strings**: no `exec(`/`execSync`/`spawnSync`/`shell: true`; `sh -c` only in `lib/runner.js` for the user's check command.
- **The Cursor CLI** (`CURSOR_BIN`) is referenced only by `config.js`, `lib/runner.js`, `lib/cursor.js`, `lib/open.js`. `runner.js` runs it for exactly three approval-gated kinds (task, plan, review); `cursor.js` may only run the no-usage `status`, `--version`, `--list-models`; `open.js` only builds command text. Cursor daily caps must not come back.
- Authorized roots only: resolve repos through `repo.assertUsable(service)` (realpath vs roots) before reading or writing; never follow symlinks out of a repo.
- The real DB: only `lib/db.js` opens a database, via `cfg.DB_PATH`; `config.js` refuses the default `data/orchestrator.db` unless the entry is `node server.js` (tests/scripts/`node -e` must set `ORCH_DB`; `test/m15-db-guard.test.js`).
- Chat/mention retrieval is read-only (git object database, pinned commit, deny list, redaction); keep it that way.
